<title>CHINA: China warns Dalai meetings could harm trade ties.</title>
<headline>China warns Dalai meetings could harm trade ties.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China warned on Tuesday that meetings between the exiled Dalai Lama and leaders of other countries, such as Australia, could harm trade and business ties.</p>
<p>&quot;About the leaders of some countries meeting the Dalai Lama, this is interference in China's internal affairs,&quot; Foreign Ministry spokesman Shen Guofang told a news briefing.</p>
</text>
